{"reviewId": "14755045_87fEOrlAh", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "微观主体的理性反应就是“不再为流动性买单”——企业减少投资、家庭减少举债，市场由“量宽驱动”转向“收益率驱动”。\n这正是周金涛强调的“流动性拐点”与“长波拐点”重合的微观基础：当需求端对流动性不再敏感，宽松政策便难以托住经济，只能等待新的技术-资本-信用扩张周期出现。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "微观主体已经无法对货币的宽松和持续宽松做出理性的反应，因为在这个阶段，不断下滑的总需求制约了微观主体的行为，他们更加注重经济基本面和未来的预期，而对流动性宽松程度的反应事实上已经下降了。", "range": "926-1019", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "14755045_87fEOrlAh", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1772261541, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 386278332, "name": "Inner peace", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIaib896nzbbjpaicR858pU5bY21SvgsnD1AxKCMUPcMhhvSVMiczKIrqRCHlFrywrFxD0ibCLzU7tDmmL22KjbX3HI5K5Wmu0hBxSRJviaZBmsVXQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}], "comm